advanced lifestyle knowledge

# Student Answer:
No, Bob Marley was not an atheist. He was a devout Rastafari, a religion that developed in Jamaica during the 1930s. Rastafarianism is a monotheistic belief system based on teachings found in the Old and New Testaments of the Bible, although interpretations and principles can vary among individuals. Bob Marley often incorporated aspects of his faith into his music.

